        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >= Gameplay =</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >POUMOSA is a Point And Click adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is intended for players who like dialogues, puzzles and wiggling mustaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396630/extras/6845d2fe189278beca318173370bb1ae.poster.avif?t=1784643545\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396630/extras/6845d2fe189278beca318173370bb1ae.webm?t=1784643545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396630/extras/6845d2fe189278beca318173370bb1ae.mp4?t=1784643545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >= Story =</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1503, Europe is captivated by the promise of the New World. Expeditions are being prepared in all the kingdoms, each hoping to obtain their share of the riches and unexplored lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play the role of Balthazar De Rochemort, a nobleman who invests in one of these expeditions and boards a ship. However, caught in a violent storm, your expedition drifts and discovers a small mysterious island, inhabited by an unknown people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study their language !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396630/extras/62cb931f176a2c96cbc3ff44323e365e.avif?t=1784643545\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396630/extras_big/62cb931f176a2c96cbc3ff44323e365e.avif?t=1784643545 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover their history !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396630/extras/d2857b12c8fd5681d87b48994f59e159.avif?t=1784643545\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396630/extras_big/d2857b12c8fd5681d87b48994f59e159.avif?t=1784643545 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share their culture !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396630/extras/db4260ca9038580a9752e1d402531172.avif?t=1784643545\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or make your trip profitable...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396630/extras/9bc26ee2c30be67cdf0bd36b8df0fa0a.avif?t=1784643545\" width=612 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your investment after all !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >= Q&amp;A =</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Why &quot;POUMOSA&quot; ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to discover it by yourself ;) !</p>",
